      "name": "Destructive Vengeance",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy within 15 feet damages the antipaladin</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The antipaladin increases the amount of damage they take by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> and deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> to the triggering enemy, choosing <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> spirit or <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> void damage. In addition, the antipaladin deals 2 extra damage of the chosen type with their Strikes against the triggering creature until the end of the antipaladin's next turn.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
